sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Kernel
    participant inotify
    participant FS as Filesystem
    
    App->>Kernel: fd = inotify_init1(0)
    Kernel-->>App: inotify fd
    
    App->>inotify: inotify_add_watch(fd, "/path", IN_MODIFY|IN_CREATE)
    inotify-->>App: watch descriptor wd
    
    Note over App: Application continues...
    
    FS->>FS: File modified in /path
    FS->>inotify: Trigger event
    
    App->>inotify: read(fd, buf, sizeof(buf))
    inotify-->>App: struct inotify_event
    
    Note over App: event.wd = watch descriptor, event.mask = IN_MODIFY, event.name = "file.txt"
    
    App->>App: Handle event (reprocess file)
    
    App->>inotify: inotify_rm_watch(fd, wd)
    App->>Kernel: close(fd)
    
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over App,FS: Real-time monitoring, No polling needed!
    end
